* --- Supply ---
VDD vdd 0 1.8

* --- Feature inputs (8 raw ECG feature voltages) ---
Vfeat0 feat0 0 0.0
Vfeat1 feat1 0 0.0
Vfeat2 feat2 0 0.0
Vfeat3 feat3 0 0.0
Vfeat4 feat4 0 0.0
Vfeat5 feat5 0 0.0
Vfeat6 feat6 0 0.0
Vfeat7 feat7 0 0.0

* ===== INPUT CONDITIONING (8 channels) =====
* Offset-binary normalization: maps normalized features to [0, V_READ]
* x_norm = (V_feat - mean) / scale; V_row = (x_norm + 4.0) * V_READ / 8.0
* Constant offset current absorbed into bias mirrors
* ASIC: differential amplifier with resistive feedback per channel

* --- Feature 0: mean=0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500014e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.49999949e-02
Econd0 row0 0 vol='v(feat0)*1.87500014e-02 + 7.49999949e-02'

* --- Feature 1: mean=0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500009e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.50000000e-02
Econd1 row1 0 vol='v(feat1)*1.87500009e-02 + 7.50000000e-02'

* --- Feature 2: mean=0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500001e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.49999973e-02
Econd2 row2 0 vol='v(feat2)*1.87500001e-02 + 7.49999973e-02'

* --- Feature 3: mean=-0.000000, scale=0.999997 ---
* gain=1.87500522e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.50000005e-02
Econd3 row3 0 vol='v(feat3)*1.87500522e-02 + 7.50000005e-02'

* --- Feature 4: mean=-0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87499992e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.50000042e-02
Econd4 row4 0 vol='v(feat4)*1.87499992e-02 + 7.50000042e-02'

* --- Feature 5: mean=-0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500024e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.50000009e-02
Econd5 row5 0 vol='v(feat5)*1.87500024e-02 + 7.50000009e-02'

* --- Feature 6: mean=-0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500013e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.50000008e-02
Econd6 row6 0 vol='v(feat6)*1.87500013e-02 + 7.50000008e-02'

* --- Feature 7: mean=0.000000, scale=1.000000 ---
* gain=1.87500009e-02 V/V, V_row = gain*V_feat + 7.49999995e-02
Econd7 row7 0 vol='v(feat7)*1.87500009e-02 + 7.49999995e-02'

* ===== LAYER 1: 8x64 DIFFERENTIAL 1T1R ReRAM CROSSBAR =====
Vgate_l1 gate_l1 0 1.8

